<title>FINLAND: EESTI UHISPANK 8-MTH PROFIT 37 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>EESTI UHISPANK 8-MTH PROFIT 37 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian bank Eesti Uhispank said in a statement on Monday its January-August pretax profit was 36.8 million Estonian kroons.</p>
<p>It did not give a comparison.</p>
<p>The bank said it expected its full-year 1996 profit to be 56 million kroons but did not specify whether this was before or after tax.</p>
<p>In 1995, the bank posted a 37.1 million kroon profit before taxes and the net profit was 35.3 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0248</p>
